---
args: { prepared: PreparedEvidence, goal: GoalContract, policy: PolicySelection }
returns: DecisionAtom[]
---
Apply this domain algorithm to prepared evidence: Select approved containment and corrective actions, assign qualified owners, and specify verification criteria before implementation. Distinguish immediate correction of defective units from prevention of recurrence and preserve unaffected production where evidence supports it.
For each field, return a value only when supported, source IDs, authority, one rejected alternative, and status established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable. Preserve contrary evidence and distinguish observation from inference.
